WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.175
Unit four. Basic First Aid!

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.786
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.836 --> 00:00:11.613
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.663 --> 00:00:15.430
Today we learn about Basic First Aid. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:19.579
Bandage. Say it with me. Bandage!

6
00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:26.283
Cut. Say it with me. Cut!

7
00:00:29.775 --> 00:00:33.075
Bruise. Say it with me. Bruise!

8
00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:40.426
Ice pack. Say it with me. Ice pack!

9
00:00:43.907 --> 00:00:47.607
Clean wound. Say it with me. Clean wound!

10
00:00:51.109 --> 00:00:55.076
Adult help. Say it with me. Adult help!

11
00:00:58.573 --> 00:01:02.689
First aid kit. Say it with me. First aid kit!

12
00:01:06.207 --> 00:01:09.574
Careful. Say it with me. Careful!

13
00:01:13.075 --> 00:01:22.372
If I get a small cut, I clean the wound and cover it with a bandage. An ice pack can help a bruise feel better. I always ask an adult for help and keep a first aid kit nearby.

14
00:01:22.422 --> 00:01:23.572
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.905 --> 00:01:30.083
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:31.283
Bruise!

17
00:01:32.171 --> 00:01:37.178
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.228 --> 00:01:38.451
First aid kit!

19
00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:45.904
Did you know? Cleaning a cut with water helps prevent germs from causing an infection!

20
00:01:45.954 --> 00:01:48.017
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.719 --> 00:01:56.508
Think and answer. What should you do first if you get a small cut?

22
00:01:56.558 --> 00:01:57.708
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:04.086
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.136 --> 00:02:06.918
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

